              </property>
              <property name="toolTip">
               <string>Convert Specular Glossiness to PBR.
Converts Specular Glossiness map(s) to PBR format.

Usage: Select Diffuse, Specular, and Glossiness maps. Select multiple maps from different sets to batch process.

- If no Glossiness map is provided, it will attempt to extract it from the Specular map.
- If extraction fails, the Roughness map will be approximated using the Specular map.
- If existing BaseColor, Metallic, and Roughness maps of the same name exist, they will be overwritten.</string>
              </property>
              <property name="text">
               <string>Spec Gloss to PBR</string>
              </property>
             </widget>
